/**
 * WeLease Pipeline — DIAGNOSTIC  v3.0.0 · 2026-08-06
 * Requires Core.gs and Shared.gs.
 *
 * Everything you run BY HAND to check something. Nothing here runs on a trigger.
 * Consolidated from four files — Diagnostic, Discover, Sanity and Cleanup — because
 * they are all the same job: answering a question about the data or the project.
 *
 * WHAT TO RUN, AND WHEN
 *   verifyProject()            after any paste. Names the missing file instead of
 *                              failing with a bare ReferenceError halfway through a job.
 *   sanityCheck()              after computeMetrics. Catches numbers that computed
 *                              cleanly but are wrong.
 *   auditSheet()               lists every tab and flags orphans. Deletes nothing.
 *   cleanupSheet()             deletes what the audit flagged, after you review it.
 *   auditScriptFiles()         which .gs files should exist in this project.
 *   discover()                 field discovery. Run when AppFolio changes.
 *   diagnoseExpiringLeases()   the filter funnel, stage by stage.
 *   diagnoseDepositFlow()      where deposit money actually goes in the ledger.
 *   diagnoseWorkOrderHistory() confirms the status filter returns completed work.
 *   diagnoseTicklerEvents()    real event values, when move-out counts look wrong.
 */

